# Firebase config. Not strictly secret (it ships inside the APK and the key is
# restricted to the package name + signing cert), but this repo is public for
# GitHub Pages and there's no reason to publish project identifiers. Re-download
# any time from the Firebase console (see README → Push notifications).
/android/app/google-services.json

# Local environment values and service-account credentials
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
service-account*.json
**/service-account*.json
